{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A First-Person Survival Sandbox</strong> with Crafting, Automation, and a Modular <strong>Moving Base</strong>\u00a0by a <strong>Passionate Indie Studio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/6376a80b6b37251b973bf17061517725.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/6376a80b6b37251b973bf17061517725.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/6376a80b6b37251b973bf17061517725.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Ark is set in a <strong>fractured world</strong>, long after a devastating <strong>technogenic collapse</strong>. You play as a survivor who finds an old train and turns it into a <strong>mobile base</strong>. Explore the ruins of a lost civilization, fight off enemies, extract and manage resources, manufacture components, and <strong>build automated systems</strong> to <strong>scale your production</strong>. Play solo or with friends as you upgrade your train, unlock new biomes, and slowly bring life back to the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/d4ec3c6b8c7af0bcc2ebee505e2218f3.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/d4ec3c6b8c7af0bcc2ebee505e2218f3.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/d4ec3c6b8c7af0bcc2ebee505e2218f3.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Moving Base</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct Outposts and Factories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Fight, and Automate</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Exploit</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of Vehicles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/3eef5cee95debe57bc54b255e8a35a65.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/3eef5cee95debe57bc54b255e8a35a65.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/3eef5cee95debe57bc54b255e8a35a65.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Moving Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train is your base, transport, storage, and safe zone. You can add carriages for labs, storage, or protection. You\u2019ll also paint it, decorate it, and customize it to survive in different environments. When you enter dangerous zones, you\u2019ll need to prepare by installing special modules, like radiation shields or air filters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/df54e5aebe0b993fc4c9ee3afdf6bdfc.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/df54e5aebe0b993fc4c9ee3afdf6bdfc.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/df54e5aebe0b993fc4c9ee3afdf6bdfc.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive, Fight, and Automate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face wild creatures, bandits, and deadly weather. Craft weapons, armor, and gadgets to survive. Build turrets and defenses to protect your train and outposts. As you grow stronger, you\u2019ll unlock ways to automate your work and run large production chains without needing to do everything by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/47090566c72550726059f7f476a83abe.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/47090566c72550726059f7f476a83abe.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/47090566c72550726059f7f476a83abe.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From inside the train, you can enter a top-down planning mode. Here, you can lay out buildings, manage logistics, set train routes, and organize your entire base network. It helps you stay in control as your production grows and becomes more complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/09037d3e7ad534d09991759053d6cdf5.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/09037d3e7ad534d09991759053d6cdf5.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/09037d3e7ad534d09991759053d6cdf5.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo or in Co-op with Up to Four Players!\u00a0Split roles, explore together, and defend your train as a team. Co-op adds new ways to play, and makes things like automation and exploration even more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/86532f29bb166e4c892d50af0e0dc4d8.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/86532f29bb166e4c892d50af0e0dc4d8.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/86532f29bb166e4c892d50af0e0dc4d8.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your weapons, train, buildings, and outfit. Mods will also be supported. Players will be able to add new content and personalize their experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/ebfd9569d9e38cede36f1a829aa00293.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/ebfd9569d9e38cede36f1a829aa00293.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/ebfd9569d9e38cede36f1a829aa00293.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The train is ready. The world is waiting. And you\u2019ve got work to do.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915840?t=1757501970","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915840?t=1757501970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/93316653ea9cff2c729bb045bfaa89d56c24109b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757501970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/93316653ea9cff2c729bb045bfaa89d56c24109b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757501970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/25a15c6c9ba8b747b3ffdd1fdfd2b069.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A First-Person Survival Sandbox</strong> with Crafting, Automation, and a Modular <strong>Moving Base</strong>\u00a0by a <strong>Passionate Indie Studio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/6376a80b6b37251b973bf17061517725.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/6376a80b6b37251b973bf17061517725.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/6376a80b6b37251b973bf17061517725.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Ark is set in a <strong>fractured world</strong>, long after a devastating <strong>technogenic collapse</strong>. You play as a survivor who finds an old train and turns it into a <strong>mobile base</strong>. Explore the ruins of a lost civilization, fight off enemies, extract and manage resources, manufacture components, and <strong>build automated systems</strong> to <strong>scale your production</strong>. Play solo or with friends as you upgrade your train, unlock new biomes, and slowly bring life back to the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/d4ec3c6b8c7af0bcc2ebee505e2218f3.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/d4ec3c6b8c7af0bcc2ebee505e2218f3.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/d4ec3c6b8c7af0bcc2ebee505e2218f3.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Moving Base</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct Outposts and Factories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Fight, and Automate</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Exploit</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of Vehicles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/3eef5cee95debe57bc54b255e8a35a65.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/3eef5cee95debe57bc54b255e8a35a65.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/3eef5cee95debe57bc54b255e8a35a65.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Moving Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train is your base, transport, storage, and safe zone. You can add carriages for labs, storage, or protection. You\u2019ll also paint it, decorate it, and customize it to survive in different environments. When you enter dangerous zones, you\u2019ll need to prepare by installing special modules, like radiation shields or air filters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/df54e5aebe0b993fc4c9ee3afdf6bdfc.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/df54e5aebe0b993fc4c9ee3afdf6bdfc.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/df54e5aebe0b993fc4c9ee3afdf6bdfc.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive, Fight, and Automate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face wild creatures, bandits, and deadly weather. Craft weapons, armor, and gadgets to survive. Build turrets and defenses to protect your train and outposts. As you grow stronger, you\u2019ll unlock ways to automate your work and run large production chains without needing to do everything by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/47090566c72550726059f7f476a83abe.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/47090566c72550726059f7f476a83abe.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/47090566c72550726059f7f476a83abe.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From inside the train, you can enter a top-down planning mode. Here, you can lay out buildings, manage logistics, set train routes, and organize your entire base network. It helps you stay in control as your production grows and becomes more complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/09037d3e7ad534d09991759053d6cdf5.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/09037d3e7ad534d09991759053d6cdf5.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/09037d3e7ad534d09991759053d6cdf5.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo or in Co-op with Up to Four Players!\u00a0Split roles, explore together, and defend your train as a team. Co-op adds new ways to play, and makes things like automation and exploration even more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/86532f29bb166e4c892d50af0e0dc4d8.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/86532f29bb166e4c892d50af0e0dc4d8.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/86532f29bb166e4c892d50af0e0dc4d8.mp4?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your weapons, train, buildings, and outfit. Mods will also be supported. Players will be able to add new content and personalize their experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/ebfd9569d9e38cede36f1a829aa00293.poster.avif?t=1757501970\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extras/ebfd9569d9e38cede36f1a829aa00293.webm?t=1757501970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915840/extra